# Markdown is linted by markdownlint, never reformatted by Prettier.
# Prettier rewrites code spans and fenced content whose exact whitespace is the
# subject of the surrounding sentence — and `templates/` is the product, full of
# frontmatter blocks and shell snippets documented character by character.
*.md

